      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that the `if/endif` blocks do not work like C `#ifdef/#endif`.\n\nThe `if/endif` blocks simply add an implicit `depends on \u003cconfig\u003e` for all configs inside the block.  So this change is duplicating symbols.\n\nI agree that we need a way to enable tablet mode detection for the keyboard  scanning.\n\nBut there is no need to create a separate guard.  You just need to remove the dependency on PLATFORM_EC_MOTIONSENSE for the tablet mode configs.\n\nI suggest breaking out the tablet mode changes into a separate Kconfig file.",
